Modifications made in this fork (2026-11-25, 2026-11-26):
  - Added sentence-level shadowing with word-level scoring (dp_shadowing_attempt)
  - Added sentence-level spaced review driven by real attempt scores (dp_srs_card)
  - Added a learning dashboard (shadowing / dictation-retell / dialogue)
  - Added dictation and retelling practice (dp_practice_attempt)
  - Added scene dialogue with local/cloud model backends (dp_dialogue_session, dp_dialogue_turn)
  - Rebuilt the scene as a rehearsal of the clip's own script: the AI speaks the next
    original line instead of generating text, speech paces the turns, and each learner
    line gets a per-line correction card (script_json, correction_json)
  - Refactored shared engines: tokenization, word alignment, sentence audio, recorded speech, recorder
  - Added migrations 0007-0012
  - Adapted the local build for Windows (PowerShell zip extraction, bundled runtime placeholders)

